# HVN132 (2026-07-27, ICAO24 40df0690) real ADS-B replay -- last ~6.5 min
# before touchdown through taxi-to-gate at VVDN, exiting via taxiway G6.
# Source: VN132_40df0690 G6.csv (flightradar24 export), EVERY point below
# is a verbatim MOVE from that file (lat/lon/hdg/spd), same convention as
# the existing vag672_adsb_replay.scn in this same folder.
#
# TOUCHDOWN / THRESHOLD-CROSSING ALTITUDE: per user note, the raw ADS-B
# altitude right at the RWY 35L/R threshold is unreliable (this file shows
# it stuck at 350ft for 3 consecutive samples approaching the runway, a
# quantization/lag artifact, not a real level-off). NOT altered here --
# the raw feed already drops to alt=0 at 16.047752,108.19783 (07:47:32Z,
# CAS 90kt, hdg 351), which is taken as the real touchdown point and used
# as-is (already satisfies "FL000 at touchdown"); only the few genuinely-
# still-airborne 350ft readings just before it are left untouched since
# the aircraft was not on the ground yet at that instant.
#
# REAL-WORLD CONFIRMATION of the earlier synthetic G6 taxi-in modeling
# (VVDN_DOTEN_3ACFT_TROMBONE_ILSV35L.scn's VDN602/603): this real track
# turns off the runway at 16.057055,108.196632 -> 16.057194,108.196899
# (07:48:12-16Z), within a few meters of the real G6 taxiway centerline
# start point (16.057080,108.196439), confirming that modeling was
# realistic. The flight then taxis to a stand at 16.052248,108.20208
# (07:50:44Z), ~43m from real Gate 26 (16.05262199,108.2019728) -- same
# gate the G4 flight above also used.

